<title>NETHERLANDS: VD MOOLEN 1996 NET RISES 49 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>VD MOOLEN 1996 NET RISES 49 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    11.25 vs   7.74</p>
<p>    Net profit			    40.8  vs  27.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Equities broker and market maker Van der Moolen</p>
<p>Holding NV said it wanted to pay a 1996 dividend of 5.25</p>
<p>guilders in cash plus a bonus of one warrant per 10 shares in</p>
<p>hand. Each warrant entitles the owner to buy one Van der Moolen</p>
<p>share at a price of 130 guilders during a three year period.</p>
<p>The company paid a 1995 dividend of 2.00 guilders in cash</p>
<p>plus three new Van der Moolen shares per 100 already held.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
